{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RoBMknM8Eo6AdbEd3tfwE2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Emergency Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n2\t\n3\t## EMG-1 Narrow exception\n4\tFor a **qualifying emergency** purchase totaling **$5,000 or less** from an **approved vendor**, advance finance approval is waived. **Manager approval remains required before proceeding**, and finance must be **notified within 24 hours after purchase**. This exception does not waive any applicable travel-office approval.\n5\t\n6\t## EMG-2 Limits\n7\tThe exception does not apply to a prohibited vendor unless the vendor has received written compliance-officer authorization under VEN-2. Without evidence that the circumstances meet DEF-1, emergency qualification is **not established** and ordinary purchase approvals continue to apply unless additional qualifying facts are supplied.\n8\t\n9\t## EMG-3 Not a blanket authorization\n10\tThe label 'urgent' alone is not sufficient to establish a qualifying emergency. An emergency does not waive manager approval or vendor restrictions.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f38443e3-3f29-4c5b-b54d-afc15fb2ffef","uuid":"991d36ca-7681-4a22-8e36-ef38cf24b71a","timestamp":"2026-10-13T20:51:40.242Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\paradox-u-sessions\\C_U_01\\U2\\03-emergency-policy.md","content":"# Emergency Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n\n## EMG-1 Narrow exception\nFor a **qualifying emergency** purchase totaling **$5,000 or less** from an **approved vendor**, advance finance approval is waived. **Manager approval remains required before proceeding**, and finance must be **notified within 24 hours after purchase**. This exception does not waive any applicable travel-office approval.\n\n## EMG-2 Limits\nThe exception does not apply to a prohibited vendor unless the vendor has received written compliance-officer authorization under VEN-2. Without evidence that the circumstances meet DEF-1, emergency qualification is **not established** and ordinary purchase approvals continue to apply unless additional qualifying facts are supplied.\n\n## EMG-3 Not a blanket authorization\nThe label 'urgent' alone is not sufficient to establish a qualifying emergency. An emergency does not waive manager approval or vendor restrictions.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
